FLUX.2 Klein, Qwen-Image, Wan 2.2 and LTX-2.3 ComfyUI templates are
adapted from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates at
d36e946293a3e6e24743942a2aa5819733a91727 (GPL-3.0).
See COMFY-LICENSE. Subgraphs have been flattened into API format, input and
output paths replaced with private job bindings, and optional alternatives
split into named workflows. LTX-2.3 uses only the first eight-step pass;
its prompt expansion and second upscale pass are omitted. Klein native
examples expose text-to-image here; manual reference examples remain upstream.

Frok changes: metadata, input/output bindings, named model/LoRA profiles,
required-source checks, preparation file manifests, and job integration.

Model files are not distributed with Frok. Download links, file sizes,
SHA-256 checksums and access status were checked against Hugging Face
repository metadata on 2026-09-15. File downloads use pinned revisions.
Each model, LoRA and third-party plugin retains its own license and access terms.
